Z||000005||Gokart||07-28-2000||09:12 PM||||I know Fiero Conversions Inc have the Fi-Air-O scoops like I had for $295.00 a set(Canadien). Their phone # is (519)972-4989. IRM (301)948-3301 has the Indy scoop for $200.00. These scoops work against the way the air moves through the engine bay to keep it cool so you'd have to make them functional like the way Oreif did with his Indy scoop. Yes Gokart'sGirl! I see a coupe in our future! If you don't want a Formula though I'll have to get one <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Gokart_sig_1.gif"> <P>Marc                     87GT||||reg||1
